uid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>标准普尔就预算和欧元雄心上调匈牙利信贷前景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition</link><description>标准普尔全球评级将匈牙利主权债务前景从负面上调至稳定，理由是总理彼得·马扎尔内阁计划采取措施削减预算赤字并最终采用欧元。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition'&gt;标准普尔就预算和欧元雄心上调匈牙利信贷前景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hungary Credit Outlook Lifted by S&amp;P on Budget and Euro Ambition&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:19:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</link><description>随着投资者重返科技股以及人工智能行业情绪改善，亚洲新兴市场股市预计每周上涨，收复了近期的部分抛售。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing'&gt;随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Emerging-Market Stocks Snag Best Week Since June on Tech Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>被监禁的巴西沙滩足球明星卷入俄美间谍纠纷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jailed-brazil-beach-soccer-star-drawn-into-russia-us-spy-dispute</link><description>一名巴西沙滩足球明星在莫斯科和华盛顿都在通缉的一名涉嫌俄罗斯间谍的争端中成为了一个不太可能的讨价还价筹码。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jailed-brazil-beach-soccer-star-drawn-in